# BC Claude pre-SCCR2685 compatibility supplement
#
# These are the 15 unique rules present in the previous generated Claude block
# but absent as exact rules from SCCR2685. Semantic overlap is retained on
# purpose so future edits cannot silently shrink the former compatibility set.

DOMAIN,api64.ipify.org
USER-AGENT,Claude*
USER-AGENT,anthropic*
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hcaptcha.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,recaptcha.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare-static.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,statsig.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,segment.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,datadoghq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,browser-intake-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,unlimited-pay.anthropic.com
DOMAIN,statsigapi.net
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,claude
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,anthropic
